WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:04.917
"You like to race?" said Dipper.

2
00:00:04.918 --> 00:00:09.189
"You must be fast, Eddy!"

3
00:00:09.190 --> 00:00:18.045
Eddy frowned.

4
00:00:18.046 --> 00:00:21.135
"I'm slow," he said.

5
00:00:21.136 --> 00:00:24.292
"I just wish I was fast."

6
00:00:24.293 --> 00:00:27.515
"I bet you're fast," said Dipper.

7
00:00:27.516 --> 00:00:38.917
"Let's all race!"

8
00:00:38.918 --> 00:00:41.825
"Okay," said Eddy.

9
00:00:41.826 --> 00:00:44.877
"Yay!" said Poppy.

10
00:00:44.878 --> 00:00:57.274
"This will be fun," said Jeb.

11
00:00:57.275 --> 00:01:02.001
Everyone lined up.

12
00:01:02.002 --> 00:01:04.758
Poppy looked at everyone.

13
00:01:04.759 --> 00:01:07.593
"Ready, set . . ."

14
00:01:07.594 --> 00:01:10.584
Honk! Honk!

15
00:01:10.585 --> 00:01:17.117
Eddy took off.

16
00:01:17.118 --> 00:01:23.743
Dipper played music.

17
00:01:23.744 --> 00:01:37.737
Jeb rolled slowly.

18
00:01:37.738 --> 00:01:40.711
Poppy drove through a puddle.

19
00:01:40.712 --> 00:01:43.580
"Woo-hoo!" cried Poppy.

20
00:01:43.581 --> 00:02:04.476
She drove through the puddle again.

21
00:02:04.477 --> 00:02:11.231
Eddy won!

22
00:02:11.232 --> 00:02:15.601
"Yay!" His friends cheered.

23
00:02:15.602 --> 00:02:21.643
"You're fast!" they said.

24
00:02:21.644 --> 00:02:24.458
A race car drove over.

25
00:02:24.459 --> 00:02:29.396
He had fancy stripes.

26
00:02:29.397 --> 00:02:32.923
"You're not fast," said the car.

27
00:02:32.924 --> 00:02:38.490
"You're just a slow dump truck!"

